urce web agent (OpenDevin successor) | Open-source git-native CLI agent | Open-source VS Code ag"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"ent plugin |\n| **Price** | **$0** (built-in free channels, or BYOK) | Free / Pro $20/mo / Max 5x $10"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"0 / Max 20x $200 | Pro $10/mo+, Business $19/seat | Pro $20/mo, Ultra $200/mo | Free (BYOK, enterpri"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"se extra) | Free (BYOK) | Free (BYOK, enterprise extra) |\n| **Model flexibility** | ✅ Multi-channel "},{"id":"p10s7","text":"BYOK: DeepSeek, AMD Radeon (free), OpenCode Go, Zhipu Vision | ❌ Claude only | ⚠️ GitHub ecosystem b"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"ound | ⚠️ Multiple models | ✅ Any OpenAI-compatible | ✅ Any model | ✅ Any model |\n| **MCP servers (o"},{"id":"p10s9","text":"ut-of-box)** | ✅ **8+ ready to use**: desktop/browser/OCR/memory/doc conversion/code exec/vision/his"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"tory | ⚠️ Native MCP, self-configure each | ⚠️ Limited MCP | ⚠️ MCP, self-configure | ⚠️ MCP, self-c"},{"id":"p10s11","text":"onfigure | ⚠️ MCP, self-configure | ⚠️ MCP, self-configure |\n| **Desktop automation** (screenshot/cl"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"ick/keyboard) | ✅ computer-use MCP | ⚠️ computer use (Beta) | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| **Browser contro"},{"id":"p10s13","text":"l** | ✅ Playwright MCP (real login state) | ⚠️ computer use (Beta) | ❌ | ❌ | ⚠️ Experimental | ❌ | ⚠"},{"id":"p10s14","text":"️ Browser Use (experimental) |\n| **Screen OCR** | ✅ Offline Windows OCR | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| "},{"id":"p10s15","text":"**Doc conversion** (PDF/Word/Excel → Markdown) | ✅ MarkItDown MCP | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ | ❌ |\n| **Long"},{"id":"p10s16","text":"-term memory** | ✅ Semantic search (local vector store) | ✅ CLAUDE.md / memory files | ⚠️ Limited | "},{"id":"p10s17","text":"⚠️ Rules level | ⚠️ Session-level | ❌ Git history only | ⚠️ Project rules |\n| **File drag & paste up"},{"id":"p10s18","text":"load** | ✅ Custom plugin (drag + Ctrl+V + first-time guide) | ⚠️ Partial | ✅ IDE native | ✅ IDE nati"},{"id":"p10s19","text":"ve | ⚠️ Web upload | ❌ | ⚠️ Paste |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### Why Choose Living-Dream-DSH?"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"1. **Zero cost**: The only \"out-of-box and fully free\" option. Claude Code costs $100–200/mo for hea"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"vy use; Copilot/Cursor start at $10–20/mo. This repo integrates multiple free model channels (AMD Ra"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"deon Cloud, DeepSeek signup bonus, Zhipu GLM-4V-Flash free vision), lowering the barrier to $0 while"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" keeping BYOK for upgrades."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"2. **Full-stack capability**: 8+ MCP servers out of the box — desktop automation, browser control, s"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"creen OCR, doc conversion, semantic memory, code execution. Others either don't support these or req"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"uire manual per-server setup. One install = full toolkit, every component battle-tested (pitfalls do"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"cumented in the troubleshooting guide)."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"3. **Chinese ecosystem**: The only full-Chinese one-stop solution. Complete Chinese docs, troublesho"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"oting manual, and anti-pitfall guide. Commercial products and OSS projects are predominantly English"},{"id":"p14s3","text":", which is a real barrier for Chinese users."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"4. **Open source + self-built**: MIT license — configs, scripts, custom plugin source all public. Lo"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"cal-first, API keys stay with you. No vendor lock-in vs. closed-source Claude Code/Copilot/Cursor; v"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"s. OSS trio (OpenHands/Aider/Cline), adds the \"pre-integrated config\" layer."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"5. **Mobile office**: Tailscale-based remote access from phone browser — a capability most CLI/IDE c"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ompetitors (Aider, Cline, Cursor) lack."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Caveats"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Free channels depend on third-party policies; stability and quotas are subject to change. Heavy/co"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"mmercial use recommended with BYOK or commercial subscriptions.\n- This repo is a DSH config pack, no"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"t an independent agent kernel; the \"framework ceiling\" depends on official DSH capabilities.\n- Compa"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"rison based on public info; some features (Claude Code computer use, Cline Browser Use) are still in"},{"id":"p18s5","text":"based on public info; some features (Claude Code computer use, Cline Browser Use) are still in Beta."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Quick Decision Guide"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Your situation | Recommendation |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| Zero-cost full-stack agent (code + desktop + browser + remote) | **Living-Dream-DSH** |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## ✨ Features"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| 🔌 **8+ MCP Servers** | History/Vision/Desktop/Code Execution/Browser/Memory/Document/OCR |\n| 🤖 **F"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ree Model Access** | AMD Radeon Cloud + DeepSeek Signup Bonus + Zhipu Free Vision |\n| 📱 **Mobile Rem"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ote Access** | Tailscale + Proxy, control DSH from phone |\n| 🖼️ **Auto Image Recognition** | GLM-4V-"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"Flash free vision (Desktop only) |\n| 📁 **File Drag & Drop** | Custom dsh-file-uploads plugin |\n| 🔐 *"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"*Secure Key Storage** | DPAPI-encrypted backup (`secrets.json` + `secrets.ps1`) alongside plaintext "},{"id":"p24s6","text":"`.credentials.yaml` |\n| 🛡️ **Troubleshooting Guide** | All pitfalls and solutions documented |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Prerequisites (Must Install First)"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Software | Version | Download | Required |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| **DeepSeek Harness Desktop** | v1.1.0+ | GitHub Releases | ✅ Yes |\n| **Node.js** | v22+ (Recommend"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ed v24 LTS) | nodejs.org | ✅ Yes |\n| **Python** | 3.13+ | python.org | ✅ Yes |\n| **pnpm** | Latest |"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" `npm install -g pnpm` | ✅ Yes |\n| **Git** | Any | git-scm.com | For clone |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"> 💡 After installing Python, run `pip install mcp markitdown zstandard` to enable all MCP servers.\n>"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" The GUI installer does this automatically."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"> 💡 The launcher auto-detects DSH Desktop from common install paths. If it fails, set\n> `$env:DSH_DE"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"SKTOP_PATH = \"D:\\Tools\\DeepSeekHarness-Desktop\"` (your actual path),\n> or add it as a system environ"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ment variable for persistence."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
